g  us back into history  mr bundy's book is available for sale  and he will be very happy to autograph  it for you thank you for being with us  thank you very much  [Applause]  it was better than all right it was  wonderful  [Music]  william bundy was the editor of foreign  affairs magazine for more than 10 years  his book a tangled web is published by  hill and wang at 19 union square west  new york new york one zero zero zero  three  [Music]
 

